    "Id": "vehicledef_VISOR_E",
    "Name": "Visor E",
    "Details": "The E configuration of the Visor Strike Vehicle is built around a Drone Controller, with the drones usually carried in an attached trailer. It is unpopular, but it makes effective use of any drones that have ended up in the Society. For immediate self-defense it mounts a Clan Plasma Cannon in the turret and two Clan Micro Pulse Lasers in the front, with a Clan Watchdog Suite hidden in the body.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 8/12 hexes / 240/360 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       155     20\n<b>Left</b>         115     20\n<b>Right</b>       115     20\n<b>Rear</b>        115     20\n<b>Turret</b>      115     20\n\n<b>Total</b>      615    100</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00>Can Resupply/Repair</color>",
